entries[201407] = { ["name"] = "Tinker: Arclight Vital Correctors", ["text"] = "Tinker Module\nUnique-Equipped: Arclight Vital Correctors (1)\nCarelessly cross a few frayed wires within the vicinity of a fallen ally in a desperate attempt to jolt them back to life with 60% health and 20% mana. Castable in combat. What could possibly go wrong?\n\nCannot be used by players higher than level 70.\n\"Tinker quality and engineering specialization impact success chance. This warranty only applies to Dragon Isles equipment.\"\nSell Price:" }
